ble search.\"\n\nContinuing the hash computation...\n\ne...a...r...c...h..., then converting the accumulated hash value into hexadecimal digits.\n\nNow I'm turning to the HTML itself: adding an h1 and intro paragraph with the hash2 class, fixing a typo on the link's hash1 class, wrapping the form with hash3, setting up the search form's action and id, and adding a label placeholder while preserving the odd meta tag exactly as-is. Then I'll output everything as a single-line escaped JSON string.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3049,"completion_tokens":5545,"total_tokens":8594,"cost":0.123096,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.123096,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.012196,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.1109},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3668,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}
