\\n<a href=\\\"13.htm\\\">12. The Tin Woodman of Oz (1918)</a><br/>\\n<a href=\\\"14.htm\\\">13. The Magic of Oz (1919)</a><br/>\\n<a href=\\\"15.htm\\\">14. Glinda of Oz (1920)</a><br/>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<form action=\\\"https://www.google.com/cse\\\" id=\\\"cse-search-box\\\" class=\\\"search-box HDLmClass3a6e9b21\\\">\\n  <div>\\n    <label for=\\\"q\\\">Search the Oz books:</label><br/>\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"cx\\\" value=\\\"002807121847390519013:ddj9f84mdsw\\\" />\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"ie\\\" value=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"q\\\" id=\\\"q\\\" size=\\\"31\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. Tin Woodman, Ozma, Emerald City\\\" />\\n    <input type=\\\"submit\\\" name=\\\"sa\\\" value=\\\"Search\\\" />\\n  </div>\\n</form>\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\" src=\\\"https://www.google.com/coop/cse/brand?form=cse-search-box&lang=en\\\"></script>\\n        </body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added charset, viewport and meta description tags\",\"Why\":\"The page now displays properly on phones, and a clear description can bring in more search clicks\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass5c1e8a42\"},{\"What\":\"Added a light stylesheet for readable type, brand colors, link spacing and button styles\",\"Why\":\"A cleaner, easier-to-read layout builds trust and makes the links easier to scan and click\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7a3d0f19\"},{\"What\":\"Added descriptive alt text to the Cowardly Lion image\",\"Why\":\"Improves accessibility and image search visibility\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass2b9e4d67\"},{\"What\":\"Added an H1 heading and a short intro saying all 14 books are free to read\",\"Why\":\"Visitors see right away what the page offers, which reduces bounces\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass4f8c2a3e\"},{\"What\":\"Added a prominent 'Start Reading Book 1' button\",\"Why\":\"A single clear starting point gets more first-time visitors to start reading\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass6d2b7e90\"},{\"What\":\"Fixed the typo 'Wixard